  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/64/Train_Station.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028125241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Town station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Town station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Town station</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>town station</b> lets <a href=\"/wiki/town-visitors-13241\" title=\"Town Visitors\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town visitors</a> get off the <a href=\"/wiki/eggspress-train-28198\" title=\"EGGspress Train\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">EGGspress train</a> into the player's <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town</a>. Repairing this station is free.\n</p><p>The town station lets players know when to expect the next train, and how many visitors will be on that train. Players can rush the arrival of the next train by spending diamonds.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The station changes appearance as the player upgrades it:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATrain_Station_Broken.png\" title=\"Train Station Broken.png (792 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3c/Train_Station_Broken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028125218\" title=\"Train Station Broken.png (792 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Train Station Broken.png (792 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATrain_Station_Stage_1.png\" title=\"Train Station Stage 1.png (826 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6c/Train_Station_Stage_1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028125247\" title=\"Train Station Stage 1.png (826 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Train Station Stage 1.png (826 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATrain_Station_Stage_2.png\" title=\"Train Station Stage 2.png (822 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fc/Train_Station_Stage_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028125421\" title=\"Train Station Stage 2.png (822 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Train Station Stage 2.png (822 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATrain_Station_Stage_3.png\" title=\"Train Station Stage 3.png (824 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e7/Train_Station_Stage_3.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028125343\" title=\"Train Station Stage 3.png (824 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Train Station Stage 3.png (824 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATrain_Station.png\" title=\"Train Station.png (839 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/64/Train_Station.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028125241\" title=\"Train Station.png (839 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Train Station.png (839 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p>Upgrading the town station allows players to increase the number of visitors per EGGspress train. Each upgrade increases its capacity and level by one. The station can be upgraded to level 12 for a maximum capacity of 14 visitors.\n</p><p>Players can upgrade the station using the following materials:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ABrick.png\" title=\"Brick.png (39 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/58/Brick.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028131743\" title=\"Brick.png (39 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Brick\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Brick.png (39 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Brick\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/brick-13236\" title=\"Brick\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Brick</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHand_Drill.png\" title=\"Hand Drill.png (22 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d4/Hand_Drill.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028131624\" title=\"Hand Drill.png (22 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Hand drill\" height=\"175\" width=\"175\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Hand Drill.png (22 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Hand drill\" height=\"175\" width=\"175\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/hand-drill-13235\" title=\"Hand Drill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hand drill</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATar_Bucket.png\" title=\"Tar Bucket.png (43 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Tar_Bucket.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028131606\" title=\"Tar Bucket.png (43 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Tar Bucket\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Tar Bucket.png (43 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Tar Bucket\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/tar-bucket-13237\" title